 26:  * @param {*} [props.departments] Departments data (required; null while loading)
 27:  * @param {boolean} [props.error] Whether loading categories failed
 28:  * @param {Function} [props.onRetry] Retry category loading
 29:  * @param {string} [props.className] Additional CSS class
